<section class="section container about-content">
  <div class="prose">
    <p class="lead">
      I have been taking things apart since childhood to see how they work. That curiosity turned
      into business: for 17 years I ran my own company, where I learned to ship projects all the way
      to the result without cutting corners.
    </p>
    <p>
      In early 2026 I moved into software engineering full-time. My stack is full-stack: Flutter on
      the client, Node.js on the server, PostgreSQL, WebRTC, PWA. I am the author of
      <a href="/en/projects/chatyadro/">ChatYadro</a>, a multi-tenant social platform for local
      communities. I took it from the first commit to production on my own: 22 community types
      with a role model, real-time chat, WebRTC audio and voice messages, and the legal
      infrastructure required by Russian personal-data law.
    </p>
    <p>
      The production version runs on <a href="https://sntchat.ru" target="_blank" rel="noopener">sntchat.ru</a>,
      and several communities use the platform daily. The Android app is published on RuStore.
      Stable and beta channels ship with automatic client updates.
    </p>
    <p>
      I am looking for a <strong>full-stack Flutter / Node.js</strong> position, remote or on-site
      in Samara. In parallel I keep developing ChatYadro and take on SEO projects.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

